      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## META-WA-SEND-MESSAGE\nInput: `wa_id`, `text`, `idempotency_key`, `requested_by`, optional `context_wamid`.\nOutput: `{ ok, outbound_id, wamid, status, error_code, error_message }`.\nNever sends twice for the same idempotency key. Refuses (OUTSIDE_24H_WINDOW) without calling Meta when the client has not written in the last 24 hours: use META-WA-SEND-TEMPLATE.\nRetries: one retry after 3 s only for HTTP 429/502/503/504. No retry after a timeout or HTTP 500 (Meta may already have sent it): the result is NETWORK_OR_UNKNOWN / META_ERROR and the caller decides.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d5e01f1b-1f6c-5aad-a6ef-d2b347bab488",
